    "title": "Armed Standoff Shuts Down Cherokee County Road Between Jacksonville and Rusk - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nate Simmons ,\n1 days ago A person believed to be armed and holed up inside a residence has triggered a major law enforcement response on County Road 1628 between Jacksonville and Rusk, with deputies and a specialized regional team working the scene into Thursday evening. The Cherokee County Sheriff's Office says the individual is considered armed and dangerous and is believed to be confined inside the home. Read full article",
